.nh
.TH umoci-raw(1) # umoci raw - Advanced internal image tooling
Aleksa Sarai
SEPTEMBER 2018

.SH "نام (NAME)"
umoci raw \- Advanced internal image tooling


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBumoci raw\fP
\fIcommand\fP [\fIargs\fP]


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\fBumoci-raw\fP(1) is a subcommand that contains further subcommands specifically
intended for "advanced" usage of \fBumoci\fP(1). Unless you are familiar with the
details of the OCI image specification, or otherwise understand what the
implications of using these features is, it is not recommended. The top-level
tools (\fBumoci-unpack\fP(1) and so on) should be sufficient for most use-cases.


.SH COMMANDS
\fBruntime-config, config\fP
  Generate an OCI runtime configuration for an image, without the rootfs. See
  \fBumoci-raw-runtime-config\fP(1) for more detailed usage information.


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBumoci\fP(1),
\fBumoci-raw-add-layer\fP(1),
\fBumoci-raw-runtime-config\fP(1),
\fBumoci-raw-unpack\fP(1)
